    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_18f32809d715d57d4df3",
      "requirement_type": "FORMAT",
      "criticality": "HARD",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/azure-bgp-oscillation-route-leak/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 11,
        "line_end": 11,
        "exact_text": "3. When oscillation or route leaks are detected, evaluate the possible solutions in the input. Load `possible_solutions.json`. For each solution, determine if it resolves oscillation and/or route leaks. To resolve oscillations, it must break the routing preference cycle in topology. To resolve route leaks, it must stop hub1/hub2 advertising routes to hub2/hub1 via Virtual Wan\n",
        "source_sha256": "2c8ed6df1fa497d911faf19f7752f4c865ecca571e5ccdc4b7ed5eb3deffd6ca",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
